<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Thursday that Union Planters Corp and Perkin-Elmer Corp were not available for after-hours trading.  </p>
<p>The exchange said Corimon SACA, Westmoreland Coal Co, Westmoreland preferred A stock and AMRE Inc were also unavailable.</p>
